          "docs": "<p>Gets information about the specified policy with the policy document of the default version.</p> <p>Requires permission to access the <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/service-authorization/latest/reference/list_awsiot.html#awsiot-actions-as-permissions\">GetPolicy</a> action.</p>"
        },
