          "docs": "<p>Creates an IoT policy.</p> <p>The created policy is the default version for the policy. This operation creates a policy version with a version identifier of <b>1</b> and sets <b>1</b> as the policy's default version.</p> <p>Requires permission to access the <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/service-authorization/latest/reference/list_awsiot.html#awsiot-actions-as-permissions\">CreatePolicy</a> action.</p>"
        },
        {
          "info": {
