          "docs": "<p>Lists the versions of the specified policy and identifies the default version.</p> <p>Requires permission to access the <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/service-authorization/latest/reference/list_awsiot.html#awsiot-actions-as-permissions\">ListPolicyVersions</a> action.</p>"
