          "docs": "<p>Deletes the specified version of the specified policy. You cannot delete the default version of a policy using this action. To delete the default version of a policy, use <a>DeletePolicy</a>. To find out which version of a policy is marked as the default version, use ListPolicyVersions.</p> <p>Requires permission to access the <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/service-authorization/latest/reference/list_awsiot.html#awsiot-actions-as-permissions\">DeletePolicyVersion</a> action.</p>"
